    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68566" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονό-κυκλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with the top made in one
				piece</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα</span> Demioprat.
			ap. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.81
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
				Subst., <i>one-wheeled cart, wheelbarrow</i>, or
			perh. <i>cart with solid wheels</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονόστροφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτερία-κύκλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.313.115
				</span></i>
			, al.</div>
